{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently, Eutolant Saga will be available in Japanese only. Future localization plans are undecided.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Path of Domination or Liberation? \u2014 A Classic Fantasy SRPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful nation engulfed in war. You are an apprentice knight who rises to face this crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the princess in escaping the advancing army, rally your allies, and travel across the world to reclaim your homeland.<br>In a meticulously crafted fantasy world, <strong>only you can command the battlefield, strategize, and restore peace to the continent!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/8587b5f07e6e98ea8552bffad9240a30.poster.avif?t=1771319318\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/8587b5f07e6e98ea8552bffad9240a30.webm?t=1771319318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/8587b5f07e6e98ea8552bffad9240a30.mp4?t=1771319318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Simple Yet Strategic System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Fast-paced turn-based battles with no screen transitions!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Form a party of over 40 unique allies!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Characters' stats grow randomly!</strong><br><strong>\u2705\ufe0f\u00a0A revolutionary backup system that boosts your growth rate when progress starts to stall!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Special items available to support struggling characters!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>No permadeath\u2014no need to reset!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Even without permadeath, injuries carry consequences!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/f01c394b33f035476272e7a8b73d1094.poster.avif?t=1771319318\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/f01c394b33f035476272e7a8b73d1094.webm?t=1771319318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/f01c394b33f035476272e7a8b73d1094.mp4?t=1771319318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lively Character Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A war chronicle brought to life by over\u00a0<strong>120 unique characters</strong>, <br>blending <strong>moments of deep drama with lighthearted banter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>a rich and engaging script</strong>, the story unfolds through lively interactions and dynamic character dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/061a32260a914a0bb23cd005c6331f2d.poster.avif?t=1771319318\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/061a32260a914a0bb23cd005c6331f2d.webm?t=1771319318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/061a32260a914a0bb23cd005c6331f2d.mp4?t=1771319318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regarding Voice Acting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters speak when selected, but there is no voice acting during story scenarios.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regarding Mouse Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse support is only available at a resolution of 1920x1080px.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish to use the mouse in full-screen mode, please open the &quot;game.ini&quot; file in the game folder and change the setting to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HardwareFullScreen=0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please note the following side effects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You will not be able to change the window size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The screen will be stretched to fit your monitor size.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Mouse Operation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse operation is only supported when the resolution is set to 1920x1080px.  <br>If you would like to use the mouse in fullscreen mode, open the game.ini file in the game folder and change the setting to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HardwareFullScreen=0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please note the following side effects:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not be able to change the window size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The screen may be stretched to fit your monitor\u2019s resolution.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note for Steam Deck Users</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The videos used in this game are in mp4 format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When playing on Steam Deck, videos may not display correctly if the environment for playing mp4 files is not properly set up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure the playback environment is ready on your own if necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, we have confirmed compatibility errors with movie playback on Proton 10.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This can be avoided by selecting &quot;Proton 9.0.4&quot; from the compatibility settings in the game properties.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Streaming &amp; Let\u2019s Plays</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and gameplay videos are generally allowed. (Monetization, archives, and clips are all permitted.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be considerate of spoilers. Adding a short spoiler notice in the title or description is appreciated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actions that cause trouble for others, such as harassment or defamatory behavior, are not allowed.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended Users</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705\ufe0f Fans of Fantasy Worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705\ufe0f Lovers of Traditional SRPGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705\ufe0f Enjoyers of Character Interactions</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u7b2c\uff11\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/c7aba05e238506f402db018092f8e15c89c92d4a.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff12\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/f8bff6e52b4d2e456ef9c8dca52db464cdb67f7e.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff13\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/01a662843287e9f7416474b4a2386058d4825a43.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff14\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/a26b7c98be9ee15db9eb8c0634ddac2227ea3a98.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff15\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/8e29f65170893fa7c2f6e7a8be45bef5c76b3410.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff16\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/becaf24584bae8cbb839a07e546a98e75b54f6ef.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff17\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/0f809a3dc3aac76f3db0eaf73f269c5d79110725.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff18\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/98bb5aea5ea2a47c92a1de1d59d3e0731fc4844e.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff19\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/3822d3f15ce5fd7f983b85b94e29a1108a74cd39.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff11\uff10\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/71dc9637622a0ba9dc6e4b2a6813884925c19430.jpg"}],"total":64},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470020?t=1771319318","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470020?t=1771319318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/71ebfccdb776f340cc128efeb5896d20e69fe89f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771319318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/71ebfccdb776f340cc128efeb5896d20e69fe89f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771319318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3500310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently, Eutolant Saga will be available in Japanese only. Future localization plans are undecided.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Path of Domination or Liberation? \u2014 A Classic Fantasy SRPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful nation engulfed in war. You are an apprentice knight who rises to face this crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the princess in escaping the advancing army, rally your allies, and travel across the world to reclaim your homeland.<br>In a meticulously crafted fantasy world, <strong>only you can command the battlefield, strategize, and restore peace to the continent!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/8587b5f07e6e98ea8552bffad9240a30.poster.avif?t=1771319318\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/8587b5f07e6e98ea8552bffad9240a30.webm?t=1771319318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/8587b5f07e6e98ea8552bffad9240a30.mp4?t=1771319318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Simple Yet Strategic System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Fast-paced turn-based battles with no screen transitions!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Form a party of over 40 unique allies!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Characters' stats grow randomly!</strong><br><strong>\u2705\ufe0f\u00a0A revolutionary backup system that boosts your growth rate when progress starts to stall!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Special items available to support struggling characters!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>No permadeath\u2014no need to reset!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Even without permadeath, injuries carry consequences!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/f01c394b33f035476272e7a8b73d1094.poster.avif?t=1771319318\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/f01c394b33f035476272e7a8b73d1094.webm?t=1771319318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/f01c394b33f035476272e7a8b73d1094.mp4?t=1771319318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lively Character Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A war chronicle brought to life by over\u00a0<strong>120 unique characters</strong>, <br>blending <strong>moments of deep drama with lighthearted banter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>a rich and engaging script</strong>, the story unfolds through lively interactions and dynamic character dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/061a32260a914a0bb23cd005c6331f2d.poster.avif?t=1771319318\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/061a32260a914a0bb23cd005c6331f2d.webm?t=1771319318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/061a32260a914a0bb23cd005c6331f2d.mp4?t=1771319318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regarding Voice Acting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters speak when selected, but there is no voice acting during story scenarios.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regarding Mouse Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse support is only available at a resolution of 1920x1080px.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish to use the mouse in full-screen mode, please open the &quot;game.ini&quot; file in the game folder and change the setting to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HardwareFullScreen=0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please note the following side effects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You will not be able to change the window size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The screen will be stretched to fit your monitor size.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Mouse Operation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse operation is only supported when the resolution is set to 1920x1080px.  <br>If you would like to use the mouse in fullscreen mode, open the game.ini file in the game folder and change the setting to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HardwareFullScreen=0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please note the following side effects:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not be able to change the window size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The screen may be stretched to fit your monitor\u2019s resolution.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note for Steam Deck Users</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The videos used in this game are in mp4 format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When playing on Steam Deck, videos may not display correctly if the environment for playing mp4 files is not properly set up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure the playback environment is ready on your own if necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, we have confirmed compatibility errors with movie playback on Proton 10.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This can be avoided by selecting &quot;Proton 9.0.4&quot; from the compatibility settings in the game properties.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Streaming &amp; Let\u2019s Plays</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and gameplay videos are generally allowed. (Monetization, archives, and clips are all permitted.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be considerate of spoilers. Adding a short spoiler notice in the title or description is appreciated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actions that cause trouble for others, such as harassment or defamatory behavior, are not allowed.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended Users</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705\ufe0f Fans of Fantasy Worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705\ufe0f Lovers of Traditional SRPGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705\ufe0f Enjoyers of Character Interactions</p>","developers":["Oistar Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/93f7d697ee7c15224f0d335d8f1e6de38b02282f/header.jpg?t=1771319318","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3470020/1704607007/8bda59f6eb44d9411c9aff8722a8f40c7b385a4f/1757287097/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757288747","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3470020/1704607007/8bda59f6eb44d9411c9aff8722a8f40c7b385a4f/1757287097/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757288747","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3470020/1704607007/8bda59f6eb44d9411c9aff8722a8f40c7b385a4f/1757287097/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757288747","id":257107753,"name":"\u30c7\u30e2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107753/8d8acfd15a81899916b30d628a72ab963b7c4d4f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757288747"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3470020/1112044639/1e7a0b2abe375c46ab3dc91b6ca72a5263d7481e/1771311728/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771312720","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3470020/1112044639/1e7a0b2abe375c46ab3dc91b6ca72a5263d7481e/1771311728/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771312720","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3470020/1112044639/1e7a0b2abe375c46ab3dc91b6ca72a5263d7481e/1771311728/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771312720","id":257288564,"name":"\u30c7\u30e2 ver.2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto